    "Commit 9bfcb7c15d explains that a snapshot with large coins 'lets the cache grow by about 1.2 GB between two checks, whatever -dbcache is. The file is only rejected at the end, when the UTXO set hash does not match.'",
    "The PR author provides a functional test case in feature_assumeutxo.py loading 2,000 coins with 10,000-byte scripts under -dbcache=4, which fails before the patch and succeeds after."
  ],
  "dependencies": {
    "depends_on": [],
